# iCloud Drive sync artifacts. It duplicates files as "name 2.ts" / "name.d 3.ts"
# when two machines touch the same path. They are never source: they broke the
# backend typecheck once (a truncated copy of generated Prisma types) and five
# of them were committed by a `git add -A` before anyone noticed.
* [0-9].ts
* [0-9].tsx
* [0-9].js
* [0-9].json
* [0-9].node
*.d [0-9].ts
